---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Meyer Sound" description="System Sound is a direct Meyer Sound distributor in Australia. Buy Meyer Sound loudspeakers, get expert advice, system design, installation and ongoing support.">
  <section class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="section-label">Meyer Sound</p>
      <h1>Direct Meyer Sound <span style="color:var(--color-accent)">distributor</span>. Australia.</h1>
      <p>Since 1985, System Sound and Meyer Sound have been inseparable names in the Australian live music scene. We're one of the country's largest Meyer Sound stockists.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="prose">
        <h2>Why Choose Meyer Sound</h2>
        <p>Since the 1970s, Meyer Sound has led the industry in loudspeaker innovation, setting the gold standard with groundbreaking scientific advancements and uncompromising quality. Renowned worldwide, they've redefined the benchmarks of sound design, inspiring other manufacturers to strive to keep pace. With Meyer Sound, you're choosing unmatched audio excellence, refined over decades of research and expertise.</p>

        <h2>Buying Meyer Sound With Us</h2>
        <p>When you choose Meyer for your venue, you're not just upgrading — you're entering a new league of quality where even your highest expectations are surpassed. With System Sound's expert advice and meticulous planning, you're backed by one of Australia's most prolific sound engineering firms, ensuring every aspect of your investment is optimised.</p>
        <p>And when you buy directly from System Sound, you gain ongoing support and expertise to keep your Meyer Sound system performing at its best, guaranteeing your satisfaction well beyond installation day.</p>
        <p>With our highly experienced specialist team, we provide system installation, tuning, service and can advise on the best products for your needs.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-intro">
        <h2>Meyer Sound Systems</h2>
        <p>From compact point-source to large-format line arrays — we stock, sell, and support the full Meyer Sound catalogue.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card-grid" style="grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(260px, 1fr))">
        <div class="card">
          <h4>PANTHER</h4>
          <p style="font-size:0.9rem">Large-format linear line array. The flagship for major theatre and concert touring.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h4>LEOPARD</h4>
          <p style="font-size:0.9rem">Compact linear line array. Ideal for theatre, mid-size venues, and installations.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h4>LFC2100</h4>
          <p style="font-size:0.9rem">High-power low-frequency control element. Unmatched bass clarity and impact.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h4>UP-4slim</h4>
          <p style="font-size:0.9rem">Ultra-compact installation loudspeaker. Perfect for front-fill, under-balcony, delay.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h4>UPA Series</h4>
          <p style="font-size:0.9rem">The classic point-source that started it all. Still a workhorse. Since 1985.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h4>Galileo GALAXY</h4>
          <p style="font-size:0.9rem">Networked loudspeaker management. The processor behind the system.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Ready to invest in Meyer Sound?</h2>
      <p>Talk to us about your venue, your budget, and your ambitions. We'll help you spec the right system.</p>
      <a href="/sales-enquiry-request" class="btn btn-primary">Request a consultation</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
